- Yes.

839
01:02:08,729 --> 01:02:10,397
No, it's not necessary...

840
01:02:10,814 --> 01:02:14,109
Until your arm gets all better

841
01:02:14,609 --> 01:02:18,780
can you stand watching them?

842
01:02:22,367 --> 01:02:23,618
Well...

843
01:02:24,327 --> 01:02:25,328
Honestly

844
01:02:26,413 --> 01:02:27,497
it's torture.

845
01:02:27,748 --> 01:02:30,125
Exactly. Let me remove them for you.

846
01:02:33,962 --> 01:02:35,047
With this.

847
01:03:02,574 --> 01:03:03,575
Well...

848
01:03:04,659 --> 01:03:06,286
- Can you take this off too?
- Sure!

849
01:03:14,294 --> 01:03:15,504
Keep it up.

850
01:03:19,132 --> 01:03:20,133
Good.

851
01:03:41,571 --> 01:03:45,492
DA-REUM

852
