- Oh, right!

857
01:04:15,021 --> 01:04:19,568
My mom said I shouldn't visit
anyone's house empty-handed.

858
01:04:20,610 --> 01:04:21,695
I almost forgot.

859
01:04:22,195 --> 01:04:23,947
