- No.

860
01:04:24,364 --> 01:04:25,699
It's from my heart.

861
01:04:28,243 --> 01:04:29,411
You didn't have to...

862
01:04:31,329 --> 01:04:34,082
<i>It's not for me. It's a gift.</i>

863
01:04:34,166 --> 01:04:37,085
