01:05:14,623 --> 01:05:17,417
<i>I am on Team Ha-gi.</i>

875
01:05:17,667 --> 01:05:18,919
<i>I am on Team Ha-gi.</i>

876
01:05:19,211 --> 01:05:20,462
<i>Team Ha-gi...</i>

877
